00:34:00,398 --> 00:34:01,558
At least thus far.

819
00:34:01,558 --> 00:34:02,598
Very funny.

820
00:34:02,598 --> 00:34:03,818
I want to ask you a

821
00:34:03,818 --> 00:34:05,038
