822
00:34:05,038 --> 00:34:05,877
Alex.

823
00:34:05,877 --> 00:34:06,698
Alex.

824
00:34:07,598 --> 00:34:11,098
You say that the case, Alex, for healthcare,

825
00:34:12,898 --> 00:34:16,357
