829
00:34:25,737 --> 00:34:26,918
Correct.

830
00:34:26,918 --> 00:34:31,078
It's asking people to support their fellow citizens.

831
00:34:32,598 --> 00:34:33,437
Correct.

832
00:34:33,437 --> 00:34:35,638
So it's not really someone else.

833
00:34:35,638 --> 00:34:36,478
Correct.

834
00:34:36,478 --> 00:34:37,838
Now can you explain,

835
00:34:37,838 --> 00:34:40,578
because you've heard there are critics here of this idea.

836
00:34:40,578 --> 00:34:41,937
So I've heard, yeah.

837
00:34:41,937 --> 00:34:44,777
Who do consider that taxing some

838
00:34:46,737 --> 00:34:49,538
to provide healthcare for others

839
00:34:50,717 --> 00:34:52,797
is a violation of the

840
00:34:52,797 --> 00:34:54,878
