852
00:35:26,998 --> 00:35:27,838
who are a member of the union.

853
00:35:27,838 --> 00:35:31,238
Well let's put aside the Declaration of Independence,

854
00:35:31,238 --> 00:35:32,478
the language of forming a more perfect union,

855
00:35:32,478 --> 00:35:36,638
actually is from the preamble to the US Constitution.

856
00:35:36,638 --> 00:35:39,638
So Alex, you've introduced the idea

857
00:35:39,638 --> 00:35:42,138
