858
00:35:44,138 --> 00:35:48,298
where we don't regard our fellow citizens as somebody else,

859
00:35:48,298 --> 00:35:51,298
but as part of us, is that the idea?

860
00:35:52,438 --> 00:35:55,098
Correct, and I think people might underestimate

861
00:35:55,098 --> 00:35:57,718
how dependent we're all on each other

862
00:35:57,718 --> 00:36:01,098
with regards to maintaining our own personal rights,

863
00:36:01,098 --> 00:36:02,458
and I think,

864
00:36:02,478 --> 00:36:06,978
by assuming that one is capable of maintaining those rights

865
00:36:06,978 --> 00:36:09,578
solely on their own as an individual

866
00:36:09,578 --> 00:36:12,078
without the help of that greater union,

867
00:36:13,938 --> 00:36:14,898
it's questionable.

868
00:36:14,898 --> 00:36:18,778
It sounds almost like the idea,

869
00:36:18,778 --> 00:36:20,258
your idea of citizenship

870
00:36:20,258 --> 00:36:22,598
