878
00:36:43,098 --> 00:36:44,618
Is that what you're suggesting?

879
00:36:44,618 --> 00:36:46,638
I think it can be considered like that,

880
00:36:46,638 --> 00:36:48,338
and it can be considered otherwise,

881
00:36:48,338 --> 00:36:49,418
and in that respect,

882
00:36:49,418 --> 00:36:52,238
there's truly no right or wrong answer.

883
00:36:52,238 --> 00:36:54,018
And what do you do, Alex,

884
00:36:54,018 --> 00:36:55,718
