891
00:37:09,778 --> 00:37:11,198
What would you say to them?

892
00:37:11,198 --> 00:37:14,258
I would say they underestimate their dependency

893
00:37:14,258 --> 00:37:16,128
on the welfare of each

894
00:37:16,128 --> 00:37:17,998
and every citizen in this country

895
00:37:17,998 --> 00:37:20,798
in order to sustain their own personal rights.

896
00:37:20,798 --> 00:37:22,558
I think there's more mutual

897
00:37:22,558 --> 00:37:24,318
dependency than they might think.

898
00:37:25,198 --> 00:37:27,038
So shared identity has something to do

899
00:37:27,038 --> 00:37:28,678
with mutual dependency.

900
00:37:28,678 --> 00:37:29,958
Correct.

901
00:37:29,958 --> 00:37:30,798
And that,

902
00:37:30,858 --> 00:37:33,798
provides an idea of commonality

903
00:37:33,798 --> 00:37:35,798
that you think argues for

904
00:37:36,798 --> 00:37:40,098
the obligation to provide everyone with healthcare

905
00:37:40,098 --> 00:37:43,098
and welfare and maybe education.

906
00:37:43,098 --> 00:37:43,938
Correct.

907
00:37:43,938 --> 00:37:45,238
What do you say?

908
00:37:47,078 --> 00:37:48,518
My name is Skyler,

909
00:37:48,518 --> 00:37:51,098
and I would like to argue that

910
00:37:51,098 --> 00:37:54,238
the utility associated for all of us

911
00:37:54,238 --> 00:37:57,618
