996
00:41:30,018 --> 00:41:33,138
falling ill without the ability to pay,

997
00:41:33,138 --> 00:41:34,878
then they're not really free.

998
00:41:34,878 --> 00:41:37,318
They're not really free to choose

999
00:41:37,318 --> 00:41:39,758
