1000
00:41:39,758 --> 00:41:44,038
This, you might call it, is the freedom argument,

1001
00:41:44,038 --> 00:41:47,838
is a reply to the libertarian argument about coercion.

1002
00:41:47,838 --> 00:41:50,028
So we have a disagreement

1003
00:41:50,028 --> 00:41:52,218
