1004
00:41:52,218 --> 00:41:56,518
The libertarians say the taxpayer is coerced.

1005
00:41:56,518 --> 00:41:56,778
It's that.

1006
00:41:56,778 --> 00:41:59,018
They have to pay for health care for everyone.

1007
00:41:59,018 --> 00:42:02,047
The defender of health care

1008
00:42:02,047 --> 00:42:05,077
who makes the freedom argument says,

1009
00:42:05,077 --> 00:42:10,238
no, but people who live under the shadow of illness

1010
00:42:10,238 --> 00:42:14,018
where they can't get health care, they're not truly free.

1011
00:42:14,018 --> 00:42:15,668
And then there's a third

1012
00:42:15,668 --> 00:42:17,318
argument beyond the practical argument.

1013
00:42:17,318 --> 00:42:19,408
In the freedom argument, there's an argument

1014
00:42:19,408 --> 00:42:21,498
